Upstox Integration
Boundary
All broker integration belongs in `backend/src/app/adapters/upstox`.
Requirements
official Upstox SDK/API
V3 market data feed
historical/intraday candles
portfolio/order updates
authentication/token lifecycle
reconnect/heartbeat handling
subscription management
protobuf decoding
rate-limit handling
broker error normalization
paper/sandbox testing
Domain isolation
Do not leak Upstox-specific DTOs into domain logic. Normalize them into internal contracts.
